        "content": "## Receptionist 3: Call Events\n`POST /webhook/fernhollow/events`, the assistant's server URL (only `end-of-call-report` is subscribed). Answers 200 at once, then, if the secret header matches:\n- one row in the **Calls** tab: caller, duration, outcome, appointment and code, Vapi's summary, recording link, cost\n- a Telegram alert to staff when the call analysis says someone needs to call back.",
